   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "1A clinician may refuse to provide TOP services, provided they refer the patient to a provider who will conduct the TOP. Non-clinical staff may not refuse to provide care to a patient requesting a TOP. 2Avoid ibuprofen if pre-eclampsia, peptic ulcer, asthma, hypertension, heart failure, kidney disease.",
   "bbox": [
    34.0,
    535.3,
    806.8,
    551.8
   ],
