   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Review the patient who had a TOP within the past 14 days Are there any of: adnexal mass (closed cervix and small uterus), guarding/rebound abdominal tenderness, foul-smelling discharge, temperature ≥ 38˚C, SBP < 80, pulse ≥ 100, Hb < 6 or respiratory rate ≥ 30?",
   "bbox": [
    44.8,
    428.8,
    797.1,
    449.9
