   "parent": null,
   "text": "Yes: Offer choice of medical TOP or surgical TOP with manual vacuum aspiration (MVA) • Check Hb and rapid rhesus antibody (Rh). Also test for HIV 124 and do a cervical screen if needed 70. • If not already done, use ultrasound to determine gestational age. If ultrasound not available, estimate gestational age by dates and examination. If dates and examination disagree or uterus felt abdominally or patient is obese, refer for ultrasound. • If gestational age determined by ultrasound and/or dates and examination agree, manage further: Book assessment",
