   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• For pain, give paracetamol 500mg-1g 4-6 hourly (max 4g/24 hours) once cramping starts and ibuprofen2 400mg 8 hourly with/after food up to 3 days. • Advise to return immediately if any of: heavy bleeding (2 pads soaked within 2 hours), fever, persistent/worsening abdominal pain or foul-smelling discharge. Refer. • Follow up within 14 days. Advise patient pregnancy is possible within 2 weeks following TOP and to avoid intercourse for 7 days after TOP.",
   "bbox": [
    95.0,
    386.6,
    675.0,
    417.4
