   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "If ≤ 9 weeks • Give single dose mifepristone 200mg orally. • Then give single dose misoprostol 800mcg sublingual to take at home after 24-48 hours: • Explain that abdominal cramping and bleeding (with products of conception) occur 2-4 hours after taking misoprostol dose and can continue (on and off) for up to a month. • If no or minimal bleeding within 4 hours advise to return to facility:",
   "bbox": [
    95.0,
    242.1,
    331.8,
    332.3
   ],
   "key": "p176-e86c2863"
  },
